---
title: "C05 — Login and session issuance · Implemented"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser client
  participant P as Web proxy
  participant A as Auth API
  participant D as Identity repository
  B->>P: Login credentials and Origin
  P->>A: Forward approved request
  A->>A: Validate Origin and rate limit
  A->>D: Verify password and account
  alt Credentials invalid
    A-->>B: Generic authentication error
  else Credentials valid
    A->>D: Store hashed refresh credential and session
    A-->>P: Access JWT and HttpOnly refresh cookie
    P-->>B: Preserve cookie and typed response
    Note over B: Access JWT stays in memory
  end
